&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The Online Data organization ensures Airbnb customers are delighted in experiences backed by real-time data. We empower Airbnb’s builders to create these experiences by offering intuitive data interfaces and tools without the need to be database experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As an engineering manager for the Control Plane team under Distributed Transactional Database org, you’ll lead a team of talented, diverse software engineers to build software to make database operations (deployment, cluster provisioning and restore, rolling restarts, configuration, scaling) reliable and automated, and to make the open-source database well-integrated with Airbnb’s Compute, Networking and Security infrastructure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A few examples of control plane services that the team owns:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Orchestration logic that handles node lifecycles of database’s storage, compute, metadata management nodes. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/airbnb-engineering/achieving-high-availability-with-distributed-database-on-kubernetes-at-airbnb-58cc2e9856f4&quot;&gt;Blog link&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Operator that automates cluster provisioning, operations and restore. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Configuration management that detects and auto-fixes unexpected configuration drifts. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Open source DevX: Make open-source development and testing (image building/testing, CICD, load testing and performance certification) frictionless.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Blue/green deployment and rollback strategy for major version upgrades.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;In the future, strives towards the direction of platformization, providing the correct constructs and semantics for customers to self-manage their databases and keep the org’s KTLO and toil factor manageable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Each manager brings their own unique skill set, experiences, thought leadership and technical expertise to solve these technical challenges for Airbnb. You will work closely with your peers within Online Data, many other partners in Airbnb Product teams, as well as Infra teams in Compute, Networking, Security, Reliability across the company and with external vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with TL and team to define and execute on a vision and 3-year roadmap for the control plane area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay in touch with technical designs and decisions, be the sounding board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize technical information and represent the team with upper management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with ORM and SRE teams in Online Data on each team’s charter and how each team’s core capabilities fit together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attract top talent, mentor individual contributors and manage their promotions and career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurture a culture of rigor and responsibly “moving fast” from design, through code review, to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Airbnb with open source communities and external alliance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of engineering management experience, with 6+ years of relevant software development experience in a fast paced tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building and operating distributed databases and services that are long-term and evolvable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in organization design for a team that is scaling up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with a public cloud provider (AWS, GCP, Azure) and their Storage, VM, networking, Kubernetes, Security offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work well within a team and with teams across the engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; . If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$204,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UI Foundation team has a deep history at Airbnb, responsible for the design system, accessibility, motion, and the tooling that connects how Airbnb designs and builds products. Within UI Foundation, the UI Tooling team is the connective tissue between Airbnb&#39;s Design Language System and the day-to-day workflows of hundreds of designers and engineers across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;UI Tooling owns the platforms, integrations, and tooling that power how designers and engineers work — spanning design tooling, UI engineering workflow tooling, collaboration platforms, and increasingly, AI-powered workflows across all three. As AI enablement for designers and engineers accelerates, this team sits at the center of some of Airbnb&#39;s most strategic infrastructure investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager of UI Tooling, you will provide the dedicated leadership this team needs to execute with consistency, clarity, and long-term strategic direction. You&#39;ll manage and develop a team of engineers, own the multi-year roadmap across UI Tooling&#39;s core areas, and serve as a cross-functional partner to Design, Product, and AI teams driving the next generation of designer and engineer enablement at Airbnb.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role directly unblocks UI Foundation&#39;s broader ambitions. With you in this role, the team gains the focus and stability it needs to move fast on initiatives that have a blast radius across every team at Airbnb that builds products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own strategy and execution across five key areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Usage of the Design System:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Figma Code Connections and Integrations, UI Development Skills and Agents, Prototyping Skills and Agents, Design Skills and Agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core UI Development Workflow &amp;amp; Tooling&lt;/strong&gt;: Component development and documentation tooling, design-to-code platforms, migration tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Design Workflow &amp;amp; Tooling&lt;/strong&gt;: Internal design platforms, Figma enablement, design tooling and Figma plugins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration Workflow &amp;amp; Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Motion spec tooling and core motion frameworks, prototyping platform contributions and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Enabling designers, engineers to be properly educated in the tools we’re providing and ensuring adoption of those tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Leadership:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define multi-year technical roadmaps for UI Tooling with clear, measurable outcomes tied to UI Foundation goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of AI-powered design-to-code workflows across Design and Engineering, establishing Airbnb as a leader in this space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cross-functional alignment with Figma, product teams, and AI/ML partners to advance Airbnb&#39;s designer and engineer enablement capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent UI Tooling in org-level planning and investment conversations, shaping prioritization and surfacing dependencies across UI Foundation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day-to-Day Execution:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and grow a team of engineers working across design tooling, developer experience, and AI-powered workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design and engineering leaders to identify workflow pain points and prioritize the highest-leverage tooling investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide technical decisions across the team — from platform architecture to AI integration patterns — bringing a senior engineering point of view to system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage staffing, prioritization, and execution consistency, driving clarity and unblocking work across long-horizon platform investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineers on the team, supporting career growth and raising the technical bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an inclusive team culture grounded in psychological safety and high performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, with 5+ years in an engineering management role leading platform, tooling, or design systems teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation in frontend or cross-platform development, with the depth to engage credibly on architecture decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving long-horizon platform investments from strategy through execution, with strong cross-organizational influence and stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or leading developer experience, design tooling, or design system infrastructure at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Figma&#39;s ecosystem — plugins, Dev Mode, Code Connections, or similar design-to-code workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to inclusive leadership and creating environments where engineers can do their best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Bonus] Experience working with AI-powered developer or designer tooling, or integrating LLM capabilities into product workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$265,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Offline Design team plays a pivotal role in designing Airbnb products offered to guests around the world. Our teammates deeply understand the needs of our guests and hosts, and continuously innovate to create world-class products. This includes a strong ability to partner with talented cross-functional team members across product marketing, business, operations, supply, and legal—to execute a shared vision and achieve ambitious goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the Experience Designer on the Offline Design team, you will be responsible for articulating what makes a great experience for Airbnb travelers. The role will have a focus on applying deep experience design expertise and an end-to-end customer perspective to define how to ensure quality at scale. Your ability to prototype new formats will enable the Supply and Production teams to scale the product vision effectively. This role will impact multiple products at Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create playbooks: &lt;/strong&gt;Test products while using research and your expertise to define best practices for various formats to uphold quality at scale across the product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality standards: &lt;/strong&gt;Hold a high standard of quality, with an ability to clearly articulate criteria and reasoning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and prototype new categories of products to test and prove out hypotheses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for various audiences&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with the host community team to create learning journeys for hosts based on experience design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educate partners&lt;/strong&gt;: Train internal teams on how to use the work to design impactful experiences at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication and alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with cross-functional teams to test strategies that align with many teams’ goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback and collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Share creative direction and feedback in a collaborative and supportive manner with internal cross-functional partners, and external partners. Be comfortable with ambiguity and changing business goals. Foster an environment of curiosity and openness. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 12+ years of creative direction, physical experience design, editorial design, and/or service design. Proven track record of working at agencies and or in-house.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative direction &amp;amp; taste&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong discernment in taste and cultural sensibilities to design authentic experiences for various types of audiences. Able to articulate feedback for what ‘great’ looks like and how to reach standards needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to drive execution across teams in a fast-paced environment, as an individual contributor. Strong ability to communicate clearly and effectively, and be flexible to coordinate across different time zones.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-centered design&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to imagine and design for various audience types and needs at global scale. Create frameworks that are specific and actionable for hosts to incorporate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial skillset&lt;/strong&gt;: Track record of taking an idea to reality and leading teams through a dynamic environment. Self motivated, organized, pushes for quality in the details, and proactive to drive the work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-cultural fluency: Life experience&amp;nbsp; in different cultures globally and accounting for various differences in designing experiences. Ability to travel as needed to test the product.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Your Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of this position, the successful applicant will need to be based in San Francisco, CA to be able to conduct their work. Currently, employees can not be located in: Alaska, Indiana, Nebraska, North Dakota, Ohio, South Dakota, Wisconsin, Alabama, Mississippi, Oklahoma, Delaware And Rhode Island. This list is continuously being updated, please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list. &amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is seeking Field Sales Interns to join the EMEA Services team for a 6-month internship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just like Airbnb disrupted hospitality, Airbnb Services is redefining the guest experience by bringing premium in-home services directly to Airbnb stays. Airbnb Services offers 10 categories (chefs, photography, massage, personal training, nails, etc.) across 280 cities, with new offerings and locations dropping regularly in the Airbnb app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a dynamic and people-oriented person to be the frontline voice of Airbnb Services in EMEA. This role focuses on the acquisition of key hosts in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a field sales, you’ll work on projects that cover the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify potential leads sourcing through online research, community engagement and local networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cold outreach:&lt;/strong&gt; connect with potential hosts through mails, cold callings as well as in-person visits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Pitches: &lt;/strong&gt;Deliver persuasive in-person conversations to showcase Airbnb Services and its offerings, effectively converting interest into host submissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with cross-functional teams to facilitate the initial onboarding of new hosts, ensuring they are well-informed and equipped for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The intern experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you’ll be integrated into a team where you’ll contribute to challenging projects. Your manager, team, and our incredible employee community will strive to be superhosts to you during the summer. We provide the support, mentorship, fun, and real world experience needed to accelerate your learning and make a real impact on our product, as Airbnb revolutionizes connection, belonging, and travel. You can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with multiple team members to achieve project milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with stakeholders across different teams to provide project updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek and provide feedback throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in and contribute to the Airbnb Services Supply team and broader Airbnb community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current master’s student (or recently graduated within the last year) in a top engineering or business school, with at least 3 years of studies completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One first commercial experience in sales, partnerships, account management, or community engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional interpersonal skills; comfortable with cold calling and initiating conversations in various formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious and scrappy mindset with an eagerness to proactively identify new tactics &amp;amp; approaches to source, engage and close successful leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, with the ability to manage multiple conversations and leads across various platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and positive communicator, both verbally and in writing, with an authentic voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about Airbnb’s mission to create belonging and economic opportunity for hosts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with social platforms (Facebook Groups, Reddit, Nextdoor) for community engagement and lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with or understanding of small business owners, hosts, or side hustlers is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Barcelona, Milan or Paris and deep local knowledge of the market and its service offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native speaker of French, Italian, and/or Spanish and fluent in English (written and spoken)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is hybrid (half remote half onsite) and you must be living in Barcelona, Milan or Paris and have work authorization for one of those countries to be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit all application materials in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€25.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€25.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for benefits and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Italy Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€20.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€20.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for benefits and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€20.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€20.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT TO READ BEFORE YOU APPLY: THIS POSITION NEEDS TO BASED IN CHINA AND NOT PROVIDE VISA SPONSORSHIP.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payments Growth &amp;amp; Personalization (PGP) is a horizontal team within Payments focused on unlocking top‑line growth and sustainable efficiency through the payment experience. We deliver user‑facing capabilities and platform levers that improve conversion, affordability, and cost, partnering closely across US, India, and China to ship at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Frontend Engineer, you will collaborate closely with the Payments Regional, Growth, and Personalization teams, leveraging your deep expertise in web technologies to lead a small frontend team and drive the development of high-quality Payments products. Your key partners will be based in the US, India, China, and Poland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers and Backend engineers on the team to review, design and develop Payments products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in all phases of software development from architecture/design through implementation, testing, and on-call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a frontend development team of 5 contractors, overseeing code reviews and ensuring consistent productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends, technologies, and best practices in Web development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of industry engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Typescript, React and related web technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern JavaScript libraries and tooling (e.g. React, npm, webpack...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in areas outside of your usual comfort zone and show motivation for personal growth without a dedicated product manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is China - Remote Eligible&lt;/strong&gt;. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. Your recruiter will inform you what cities you are able to work from depending on your personal legal working identity and Airbnb internal policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Airbnb, the Growth Marketing team sits at the dynamic crossroads of marketing, engineering, and data science. We’re responsible for driving Airbnb’s business performance by deploying innovative, data-driven marketing strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Growth Marketing Lead, you’ll have a unique opportunity to shape Airbnb’s growth narrative in Japan. You’ll be the champion for Growth Marketing channels, translating strategic vision into actionable plans and flawless execution. You’ll identify and prioritize high-impact opportunities, manage complex cross-functional projects, and collaborate with global and regional teams. Your leadership will ensure not only the ongoing success of our core marketing programs, but also the discovery of new areas of growth for your market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and Execute Growth Marketing Strategies: Identify and incorporate local nuances to infuse authentic local flavor into Growth Marketing initiatives, ensuring strategies are tailored to resonate with local cultures, preferences, and market conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership: Build strong relationships with regional and global teams, setting and managing expectations effectively to deliver measurable business impact. Establish and optimize operating rhythm and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management: Partner closely with Regional Marketing, Engineering, Product, Data Science, and Creative teams to align on priorities, shape product roadmaps, and lead the planning and execution of Growth Marketing initiatives—ensuring flawless delivery, clear accountability, and effective communication across all levels. Strategic Vision &amp;amp; Hands-On Execution: Operate at both strategic and tactical levels—setting vision, defining KPIs, and rolling up your sleeves to support the execution and optimization of growth campaigns in-market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insights &amp;amp; Reporting: Build strong relationships with Japan Business and Marketing Teams and ensure alignment across initiatives. In regional leadership reviews, represent Growth Marketing, provide actionable insights, clear reporting, and thoughtful recommendations to guide strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Marketing Expertise: 10+ years of&amp;nbsp; relevant work experience in Growth Marketing&amp;nbsp; (Search, CRM, Display, and Affiliate), with proven track record of scaling business for B2C brands ideally in fast-paced, global environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Japan Market Mastery: Deep understanding of the Japan market, consumer trends, and digital behaviors, with experience tailoring strategies for Japan and working with local agencies and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and Strategic: Expert at leveraging data to prioritize opportunities, drive decision-making, and measure business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Proven ability to influence and drive product conversations with engineering, design, creative and data science partners. Experience working with global channel owners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management Excellence: Highly organized self-starter who thrives in dynamic environments; able to independently manage complex projects from strategy to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management: Exceptional communicator who builds trust and alignment with senior leadership, peers, and global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-Driven: Relentless focus on outcomes, with a track record of delivering against ambitious goals through innovation, iteration, and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Acumen: Familiarity with marketing automation, analytics tools, and digital platforms; able to translate business needs into technical requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Airbnb, the Growth Marketing team sits at the dynamic crossroads of marketing, engineering, and data science. We’re responsible for driving Airbnb’s business performance by deploying innovative, data-driven marketing strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As Growth Marketing Lead, you will help shape Airbnb’s growth strategy in Korea by identifying opportunities, generating insights, and partnering with global and regional teams to deliver impact in the Korean market.&lt;br&gt;This role sits at the intersection of market insights, strategy, and cross-functional collaboration. You will analyze performance data, identify opportunities unique to Korea’s digital ecosystem, and work closely with regional channel owners and global teams to ensure campaigns, product capabilities, and marketing initiatives are optimized for the Korean market.&lt;br&gt;Success in this role requires strong understanding of the Korean digital landscape, including local platforms such as Naver and Kakao, and the ability to translate market insights into actionable strategies that global teams can execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Insights and Opportunity Identification: Analyze performance data, customer behavior, and market trends to identify growth opportunities and inform Korea-specific marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Strategy Development: Translate insights into clear growth strategies and recommendations for Korea, partnering with regional and global channel owners who lead campaign execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local Platform Execution: Drive performance across key Korean platforms including the Naver and Kakao ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner with regional channel experts, global marketing teams, Product, Engineering, Data Science, and Creative partners to bring Korea-specific growth initiatives to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Korea Market Advocacy: Represent the needs of the Korean market in global planning discussions and ensure strategies reflect local platform dynamics and consumer behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-Specific Initiatives: Identify and support new builds, integrations, and marketing capabilities needed to unlock growth in Korea.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insights and Reporting: Deliver clear reporting and actionable insights to Korea leadership and regional teams to guide decision-making and continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Marketing Experience: 8+ years of experience in growth marketing, performance marketing, or digital strategy roles within consumer-focused businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Korea Digital Ecosystem Knowledge: Strong understanding of the Korean digital landscape, consumer behaviors, and local platform ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Experience: Familiarity with the Naver ecosystem, including advertising products such as Powerlink and Brand Search. Understanding of Kakao platforms, including KakaoTalk and related marketing or messaging capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data and Analytical Thinking: Ability to interpret performance data, identify insights, and translate analysis into strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Experience working with global marketing teams, product, engineering, and data partners in highly collaborative environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MarTech and Innovation: Familiarity with marketing automation platforms, analytics tools, and emerging technologies such as AI-driven marketing tools or localized asset development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb.org provides emergency housing to people in times of crisis. Since being founded in 2020, we have provided stays for more than 200,000 people in more than 130 countries. Our goal is to exponentially increase Airbnb.org’s reach and impact over the next three years. Learn more at Airbnb.org. This position is employed by Airbnb Inc. and the role provides direct support to Airbnb.org, an independent 501(c)(3) nonprofit, governed by a Board of Directors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Head of Fundraising, you will spearhead the development and implementation of a new, unique fundraising operation, focusing on cultivating and stewarding high-value donors to secure significant contributions for Airbnb.org. This role demands strategic vision, exceptional relationship-building skills, and a commitment to maximizing both financial and relational outcomes. You will build and lead a small team dedicated to fundraising operations and outreach. And you will collaborate with our marketing and design teams to build a compelling donor experience that produces high growth rates for revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A typical day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a comprehensive fundraising program aimed at fostering consistent growth of Airbnb.org&#39;s $10K+ donor community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Donor Cultivation and Solicitation:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a portfolio of major donors, including the identification, cultivation, solicitation and stewardship cycles leading to gifts of $50,000+ to support Airbnb.org&#39;s mission.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Revitalization: &lt;/strong&gt;Re-energize and expand a small existing portfolio of the organization’s donors, implementing a moves management process and identifying new prospects for engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospect Strategy Implementation: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop and execute tailored prospect strategies to drive successful cultivation, engagement, and solicitation efforts, guiding prospects through appropriate giving levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Planning and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; In collaboration with the marketing and design teams, lead the planning and execution of campaigns (e.g. Annual Fund and Emergency Response), overseeing all aspects from design to donor reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Organize and manage fundraising and friendraising events, ensuring seamless execution and effective follow-up strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Institutional Fundraising:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive institutional and foundation fundraising efforts, including grant research, proposal writing, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Donor Engagement Experiences: &lt;/strong&gt;Create engaging experiences to educate and inspire major gifts donors and prospects, utilizing impactful storytelling through various communication channels, platforms and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Oversight and Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with the Executive Director to develop and monitor budgets for fundraising activities, producing internal and external reports on goal projections and achievements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee accurate and comprehensive data entry into Salesforce, capturing relevant data that will inform fundraising strategies and donor interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum 12 years demonstrated experience in development and major gifts fundraising, with a proven track record of cultivating and closing six- and seven-figure gifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven success in frontline fundraising and supervising fundraising teams, with the ability to scale up teams and systems for optimal performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Long-term strategic thinking complemented by strong execution skills in a dynamic, results-oriented environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding written and verbal communication skills to effectively convey the mission of Airbnb.org to diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to build strong relationships and influence business leaders, fostering collaboration and support for fundraising initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility: &lt;/strong&gt;Willingness to travel frequently and work evenings and weekends as needed to meet donor engagement and fundraising goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in research, analysis, and database navigation, with a strong working knowledge of Salesforce preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Philanthropic Landscape:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of the broader philanthropic landscape, prospect research methodology, and evolving trends in philanthropy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$204,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb’s public policy team exists to further the interests of our community of hosts and guests with politicians, regulators, opinion leaders and others who shape the political and legal context for our business, helping them to understand the significant social and economic contributions of our platform. Across the EMEA region, we are engaged in well over a hundred local conversations and negotiations with governments big and small.&amp;nbsp; We engage governments at local, regional and national levels directly and also use innovative advocacy and partnership strategies that actively involve our community and our stakeholders in making the case for fair, progressive home sharing rules and travel affordability..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Government Relations and Policy Campaigns, Italy is responsible for developing and executing fully integrated Policy strategic engagement plans in the region and leading the local team, under the direction of the Director of Public Policy and Campaigns, EMEA. The successful candidate will use all available strategies, informed by data and insights, that aims to protect and further the legitimacy of Airbnb and our community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Your primary responsibility is team leadership - line managing an energetic, and passionate group of experts, in Policy and Strategic Engagement, who deliver complementary strands of work to serve the overall strategy. You inspire others to get behind a common vision and you deploy first-rate organisational skills to ensure that your strategy is executed, targets are set, and projects are delivered, on time and on budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team culture and performance management: &lt;/strong&gt;You create and maintain an inclusive culture and ways of working for your team, in line with Airbnb’s Core Values, and you are committed to embracing diversity and fostering belonging. You are accountable for performance management and feedback in line with the Company’s expectations, and also recruitment and succession planning. You empower members of your team to work on local and regional projects that develop their professional, operational and strategic skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development and cross functional alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;You determine an appropriate strategy for each priority geography in the region, as determined through close collaboration with the business leader in the territory. You define the ultimate policy goals and priorities, and develop operational plans that deliver measurable progress towards those goals in partnership with your local team. These plans and strategies are always founded on high-quality insights and data analysis, and are well aligned with Airbnb’s global approach. You also develop these strategies in close collaboration with colleagues on the wider EMEA team who have expertise in the core campaign functions, and have a regional perspective on best practices and learnings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication and Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; You work with your local Airbnb Leadership (e.g. Country Manager, marketing lead, legal counsel, Comms, etc.) to align Government engagement, policy partnerships and campaign plans with critical business priorities and outcomes. You ensure that internal stakeholders understand the campaign strategy plans, that decisions are made in a timely manner, and that information is flowing smoothly to everyone with a “need to know”. You ensure that progress is being reported regularly, and that roadblocks and successes are being flagged appropriately. You are able to confidently communicate with senior leaders about your campaign’s priorities, to manage expectations where required and to coordinate with other teams to achieve greater goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Advocacy: &lt;/strong&gt;you represent Airbnb at the most senior political levels in your geography, and with the media. You ensure that Airbnb builds and maintains relationships with the widest possible network of contacts in local, regional and national legislative, executive and administrative offices, and also with coalitions who can advance Airbnb’s advocacy initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 20 years experience working with complex political or regulatory issues in relevant business or non-governmental organisation, or in a political, governmental or regulatory context. Ideally, this experience has been built in travel, urbanism or technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate a complex political or regulatory environment. Advanced knowledge of the political landscape and legislative processes in Italy, Greece and the EU, Israel a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly get up to speed on complex technical and regulatory issues, and understand how these can be managed using a broad range of campaigning strategies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior leadership experience, with track record of managing, supporting and developing diverse multidisciplinary teams; Proven ability in core management skills - effective delegation, empowerment, performance management, coaching and talent development;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of managing complex projects with multiple stakeholders. Ability to multi-task by prioritizing work and coordinating required support across various functions to achieve project goals and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategist, creative thinker and expert communicator (spokesperson) , with great interpersonal, writing and presentation skills;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a good sense of humor and the ability to thrive in a fast moving and sometimes stressful environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must speak fluent Italian and English. An additional European language would be an asset. You must submit your application in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is located in Rome but can involve working from home, with frequent travel to countries in SEE and Brussels, and also to our global headquarters in San Francisco.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Italy Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€132.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€165.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Homes Supply team is responsible for growing Airbnb’s supply base and ensuring we maintain a diverse, high-quality portfolio of home listings that meet guest expectations for value, variety, and experience. The team also supports hosts globally by enabling efficient planning and execution of growth strategies that align with Airbnb’s mission and resonate with local communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll shape the growth and performance of Airbnb’s Homes business across Canada. Leading a team of Market Managers, you’ll drive strategies that expand high-quality supply, strengthen host success across every segment, and enhance the guest experience. You’ll work hand-in-hand with the Country Manager to execute country strategic plans, translating vision into measurable results. Through close collaboration with cross-functional partners, you’ll ensure Airbnb continues to deliver exceptional value to both guests and hosts in every market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and inspire&lt;/strong&gt; a team of Market Managers and Market Associates to grow Airbnb’s Homes supply across Canada, expanding partnerships with hosts of all types and driving exceptional business and guest outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner closely with the Country Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to execute country strategic plans, ensuring alignment between local market execution and national business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and execute acquisition strategies&lt;/strong&gt; to bring new, high-quality supply to Airbnb by developing innovative programs, pilots, and local initiatives to reach untapped segments and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment boldly &lt;/strong&gt;to unlock new sources of supply - measure results, refine quickly, and turn proven strategies into playbooks that fuel Airbnb’s growth across Canada and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide territory-level strategies&lt;/strong&gt; for acquisition, optimization, and host quality, directing teams to tailor their approach based on market maturity and host segmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Supply Leadership, Marketing, RevOps, Policy, and Product to launch initiatives that improve host performance and accelerate supply growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor and own business performance&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring markets meet revenue, supply, and quality KPIs while delivering sustainable results that support Airbnb’s broader goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify market trends and opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;, providing solutions to overcome barriers and capitalize on emerging demand or regulatory shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach and develop talent&lt;/strong&gt;, building a high-performing team culture that values experimentation, accountability, and continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in global operations, business development, or marketplace management, with &lt;strong&gt;5+ years in a people-leadership role&lt;/strong&gt; managing and scaling teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep market expertise and strong understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;Canadian travel and hospitality landscape&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience driving local growth and community engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A combination of &lt;strong&gt;operational&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and commercial skills&lt;/strong&gt; that will allow you to acquire supply across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;bold, compassionate, and action-oriented leader&lt;/strong&gt; with a &lt;em&gt;strong bias for action&lt;/em&gt; and a proven ability to develop, coach, and empower high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical and strategic thinker&lt;/strong&gt; who uses data and insights to uncover opportunities, shape portfolio strategies, and guide decisions across diverse and evolving markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to &lt;strong&gt;influence product, policy, and cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; to unlock new revenue streams and improve host and market performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at leveraging tools, dashboards, and analytics to &lt;strong&gt;assess performance, identify trends, and drive accountability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in &lt;strong&gt;achieving strong results through others&lt;/strong&gt;, including effective performance management and development of emerging leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Known for creating a &lt;strong&gt;positive, driven, and inclusive team culture&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in collaboration, transparency, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized as a &lt;strong&gt;go-to leader&lt;/strong&gt; who provides clear direction, constructive feedback, and hands-on business coaching to drive both results and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and adept at &lt;strong&gt;leading multiple initiatives simultaneously&lt;/strong&gt;, turning strategy into action and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience &lt;strong&gt;growing supply and building partnerships with community and host groups&lt;/strong&gt; is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is newly created and does not replace or backfill an existing position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is Canada - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a province where Airbnb Canada, Inc. has a registered entity. Currently we can hire in the following provinces: Ontario, British Columbia, Quebec, and Saskatchewan. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with your recruiter on what provinces you are eligible to work from.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We use automated tools to help our recruiting team efficiently screen a large volume of applications. All final hiring decisions are made by a human reviewer.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This role is newly created and does not replace or backfill an existing position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$205,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Homes team is responsible for growing Airbnb’s destination business and growing the supply ensuring we maintain a competitive portfolio of Accommodation listings that meet guest expectations for value, variety, and experience. The team also supports hosts globally by enabling efficient planning and execution of growth strategies that align with Airbnb’s mission and resonate with local communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will report to the Asia Pacific Head of Homes and shape the growth and performance of Airbnb’s Homes business across Southeast Asia Leading a&amp;nbsp; team of high caliber Market Managers across the region, You’ll drive strategies that expand high-quality supply, strengthen host success across every segment, and enhance the guest experience. and set Through close collaboration with cross-functional partners, such as Global Markets, Policy, Legal and Comms&amp;nbsp; you’ll ensure Airbnb continues to deliver exceptional value to both guests and hosts in every market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire a team of Account Managers to grow Airbnb’s Homes and Hotel business across Southeast Asia, expanding partnerships with hosts of all types and driving exceptional business and guest outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of Acquisition Managers and Vendors to increase the supply of high quality accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Destination Southeast Asia strategies to grow the destination business directing teams to tailor their approach based on market maturity and host segmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute acquisition strategies to bring new, high-quality supply to Airbnb by developing innovative programs, pilots, and local initiatives to reach untapped segments and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment boldly to unlock new sources of supply - measure results, refine quickly, and turn proven strategies into playbooks that fuel Airbnb’s growth across Southeast Asia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Global Markets, Marketing, RevOps, Policy, and Product to launch initiatives that improve host performance and accelerate destination growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and own business performance, ensuring markets meet revenue, supply, and quality KPIs while delivering sustainable results that support Airbnb’s broader goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify market trends and opportunities, providing solutions to overcome barriers and capitalize on emerging demand or regulatory shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop talent, building a high-performing team culture that values experimentation, accountability, and continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience, in Commercial roles, Strategy, global operations, business development or marketplace management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience in tech, FMCG or Travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5+ years in a people-leadership role managing and scaling teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise and strong understanding of the Regulated Markets n tech industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Management Consulting is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and strategic thinker who uses data and insights to uncover opportunities, shape portfolio strategies, and guide decisions across diverse and evolving markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A combination of operational and commercial skills that will allow you to acquire supply across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bold, compassionate, and action-oriented leader with a &lt;em&gt;strong bias for action&lt;/em&gt; and a proven ability to develop, coach, and empower high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence product, policy, and cross-functional teams to unlock new revenue streams and improve host and market performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at leveraging tools, dashboards, and analytics to assess performance, identify trends, and drive accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in achieving strong results through others, including effective performance management and development of emerging leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Known for creating a positive, driven, and inclusive team culture grounded in collaboration, transparency, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized as a go-to leader who provides clear direction, constructive feedback, and hands-on business coaching to drive both results and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and adept at leading multiple initiatives simultaneously, turning strategy into action and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;growing supply and building partnerships &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;is highly valued.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
