&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Data engineering foundations, including ability to work with data engineering teams on pipeline design, metric computation jobs, data model changes, and maintaining reliable end-to-end metric systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
