&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a product leader to drive the transformation of Airbnb&#39;s homepage and discovery for our guest experience. In this key role, you’ll be responsible for Airbnb’s Hompeage—making it effortless for every guest to discover the most relevant Homes, Services, Experiences, and offerings yet to come, as soon as they open the Airbnb app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You’ll partner closely with design, engineering, and data teams to invent new browsing tools with the latest AI technologies and intuitive UI formats that delight our users. You will partner closely with our marketing team to ensure Airbnb’s voice and discovery journey expands into our lifecycle campaigns and new marketing programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
