&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a connective tissue between the EMEA Homes team and key partners including Product, Marketing, Policy, Finance, Data Science, and Customer Service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate alignment across stakeholders on high-priority projects and regional launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent EMEA Homes perspectives in global Biz Ops forums and planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
