&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in sales, account management, or partner support, with a strong track record of building and growing business relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally across multiple stakeholders, with the ability to influence and align teams toward shared goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate effectively within highly regulated, policy-driven environments, balancing business objectives with compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage a leads pipeline and book of business, driving growth and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative skills with the ability to interpret data and apply insights to decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate at both strategic and tactical levels, with success in ambiguous and fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills across phone, email, and in-person interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with strong time management, prioritization, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
