&lt;li&gt;Prior real-word experience and demonstrable knowledge in any of Java, GraphQL, Python, Go, Rust, C/C++/C#.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and/or developing concurrency, multithreading and synchronization in large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or desire to work collaboratively in cross-functional teams with design, product, data science, and research partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in analyzing extensive data sets to identify gaps and inconsistencies, offering data insights, and advancing effective product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in designing and deploying high-performance systems with reliable monitoring and logging practices. Possess a working knowledge of relational databases and expertise in query authoring (SQL).&lt;/li&gt;
